{#
settings/_whats_new.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Whether What's new opens by itself after an update (#165).

The way back from "Don't show this after updates" in the dialog's footer, and
the same On/Off control Images uses beside it: a plain form that submits on
change and redirects. Off means quiet — no dialog and no dot on the ? — and
the hint says that the notes are still one click away.

Accepts:
  show  bool
#}
{% set segText = 'flex h-full items-center justify-center px-3 py-1.5 text-center text-[11px] leading-tight text-ink-muted
                  peer-checked:bg-accent peer-checked:text-accent-ink
                  peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-inset peer-focus-visible:ring-accent
                  transition-colors cursor-pointer' %}
<div class="px-4 py-3">
<form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_whats_new_update') }}" data-turbo="false" data-controller="ui--auto-submit">
    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-whats-new') }}">
    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="min-w-0">
            <span class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">{{ 'settings.whats_new.show'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="block text-[11px] text-ink-faint mt-0.5">{{ 'settings.whats_new.show_hint'|trans }}</span>
        </span>
        <div class="grid grid-flow-col auto-cols-fr shrink-0 rounded-pane border border-line overflow-hidden"
             role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ 'settings.whats_new.show'|trans }}">
            {% for on in [true, false] %}
                <label>
                    <input type="radio" name="show" class="peer sr-only"
                           value="{{ on ? '1' : '0' }}"
                           data-action="change->ui--auto-submit#submit"
                           {{ show == on ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                    <span class="{{ segText }}">
                        {{ (on ? 'settings.whats_new.on' : 'settings.whats_new.off')|trans }}
                    </span>
                </label>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</form>
</div>
